  <div class="prose">
    <p>Everything above the fold on this site — the digest, the deal tape, the events calendar — is independent editorial coverage. I don't get paid by the companies in it, and I have no financial stake in the deals I report on there.</p>
    <p>This page is different, on purpose. From time to time I'm personally involved — as an advisor, introducer, or co-investor — in raising capital for select private opportunities: pre-IPO rounds, SPVs, and similar structures. Those deals never appear in the digest, because I have a direct financial interest in them and a reader can't see that through an anonymous-looking deal card. They live here instead, clearly labeled as what they are.</p>
    <p>I'm not listing specific live opportunities on this public page — most of this kind of dealflow is confidential, restricted to accredited or qualified investors, and not something that belongs on an open website regardless of disclosure. If you're an accredited investor and want to know what's currently available, reach out directly and I'll follow up under appropriate terms.</p>
